[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 7.52,
    "text": "Welcome"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.4,
    "end": 15.12,
    "text": "Find a comfortable position seated or lying down"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.88,
    "end": 20.96,
    "text": "Let your hands rest easily"
  },
  {
    "start": 23.76,
    "end": 33.6,
    "text": "With no effort, allow your eyes to close softly"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.64,
    "end": 42.08,
    "text": "Take a slow, easy breath in"
  },
  {
    "start": 46.24,
    "end": 47.68,
    "text": "And exhale gently"
  },
  {
    "start": 53.52,
    "end": 55.52,
    "text": "Let your body begin to soften"
  },
  {
    "start": 62.32,
    "end": 64.32,
    "text": "Notice the surface supporting you"
  },
  {
    "start": 69.28,
    "end": 69.84,
    "text": "Steady"
  },
  {
    "start": 71.92,
    "end": 72.64,
    "text": "Reliable"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.16,
    "end": 74.96,
    "text": "Here for you"
  },
  {
    "start": 81.68,
    "end": 83.68,
    "text": "Now bring awareness to your breath"
  },
  {
    "start": 87.76,
    "end": 89.04,
    "text": "Noticing the rise"
  },
  {
    "start": 92.08,
    "end": 92.8,
    "text": "And the fall"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.0,
    "end": 97.2,
    "text": "Breath moving in"
  },
  {
    "start": 98.88,
    "end": 100.4,
    "text": "And breath moving out"
  },
  {
    "start": 104.72,
    "end": 105.84,
    "text": "Nothing to change"
  },
  {
    "start": 107.04,
    "end": 108.4,
    "text": "Just a gentle rhythm"
  },
  {
    "start": 117.04,
    "end": 121.2,
    "text": "With each exhale, allow tension to release"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.2,
    "end": 131.92,
    "text": "With each inhale, allow ease to arrive"
  },
  {
    "start": 138.56,
    "end": 141.68,
    "text": "Breathing out, letting go"
  },
  {
    "start": 145.36,
    "end": 148.64,
    "text": "Breathing in, receiving calm"
  },
  {
    "start": 148.64,
    "end": 161.12,
    "text": "Now, begin to bring to mind something you are grateful for within yourself"
  },
  {
    "start": 166.56,
    "end": 168.0,
    "text": "It may be your strength"
  },
  {
    "start": 169.6,
    "end": 170.64,
    "text": "Your resilience"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.0,
    "end": 173.68,
    "text": "Your capacity to care"
  },
  {
    "start": 178.48,
    "end": 179.92,
    "text": "Choose one quality"
  },
  {
    "start": 181.12,
    "end": 183.36,
    "text": "And let gratitude rise for it"
  },
  {
    "start": 191.52,
    "end": 194.4,
    "text": "Feel it settle warmly in your chest"
  },
  {
    "start": 202.08,
    "end": 207.04,
    "text": "Next, bring to mind someone in your life you are grateful for"
  },
  {
    "start": 208.48,
    "end": 211.52,
    "text": "It could be your kindness"
  },
  {
    "start": 211.52,
    "end": 212.72,
    "text": "It could be a friend"
  },
  {
    "start": 214.32,
    "end": 214.96,
    "text": "A teacher"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.56,
    "end": 217.36,
    "text": "A loved one"
  },
  {
    "start": 218.96,
    "end": 221.6,
    "text": "Even a stranger who showed you kindness"
  },
  {
    "start": 226.4,
    "end": 229.44,
    "text": "Picture them gently in your awareness"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.48,
    "end": 236.56,
    "text": "Feel gratitude for their presence"
  },
  {
    "start": 236.56,
    "end": 241.2,
    "text": "For the way they touched your life"
  },
  {
    "start": 249.6,
    "end": 253.6,
    "text": "Now, expand your awareness outward"
  },
  {
    "start": 253.6,
    "end": 259.68,
    "text": "Bring to mind something in the world around you that you are grateful for"
  },
  {
    "start": 259.68,
    "end": 266.08,
    "text": "Perhaps the warmth of the sun"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.72,
    "end": 268.72,
    "text": "The beauty of nature"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.72,
    "end": 275.12,
    "text": "The comfort of a safe space"
  },
  {
    "start": 280.64,
    "end": 283.28,
    "text": "Allow yourself to savor this gratitude"
  },
  {
    "start": 284.4,
    "end": 286.88,
    "text": "Letting it fill you with a quiet joy"
  },
  {
    "start": 294.88,
    "end": 298.0,
    "text": "Notice how gratitude feels in the body"
  },
  {
    "start": 304.08,
    "end": 306.32,
    "text": "Perhaps a softening in the chest"
  },
  {
    "start": 310.32,
    "end": 311.92,
    "text": "A lightness in the breath"
  },
  {
    "start": 315.76,
    "end": 318.16,
    "text": "A gentle warmth through your whole being"
  },
  {
    "start": 324.8,
    "end": 326.0,
    "text": "Silently repeat"
  },
  {
    "start": 327.6,
    "end": 328.56,
    "text": "I am grateful"
  },
  {
    "start": 331.44,
    "end": 332.32,
    "text": "I am open"
  },
  {
    "start": 335.52,
    "end": 337.28,
    "text": "I am at peace"
  },
  {
    "start": 343.68,
    "end": 344.08,
    "text": "Again"
  },
  {
    "start": 356.24,
    "end": 364.0,
    "text": "Let these words echo with each breath"
  },
  {
    "start": 368.88,
    "end": 370.88,
    "text": "Anchoring you in the present moment"
  },
  {
    "start": 370.88,
    "end": 378.08,
    "text": "Take a final deep inhale"
  },
  {
    "start": 382.56,
    "end": 384.0,
    "text": "And exhale fully"
  },
  {
    "start": 389.92,
    "end": 391.2,
    "text": "When you feel ready"
  },
  {
    "start": 392.64,
    "end": 395.36,
    "text": "Gently wiggle your fingers and toes"
  },
  {
    "start": 395.36,
    "end": 400.56,
    "text": "Softly open your eyes"
  },
  {
    "start": 408.08,
    "end": 410.08,
    "text": "Carry this gratitude with you"
  },
  {
    "start": 411.04,
    "end": 416.88,
    "text": "Into the rest of your day"
  },
  {
    "start": 416.88,
    "end": 418.88,
    "text": "In the midst of your eyes"
  },
  {
    "start": 418.88,
    "end": 419.64,
    "text": "I am in the midst of your eyes"
  },
  {
    "start": 419.64,
    "end": 419.92,
    "text": "I am in the midst of my eyes"
  }
]
